# L §7.6 item 1, §2.1 (tally 2.1.6, issues #89, #48): a day range by 7 from 9999-12-04 ends its last period on
# 9999-12-31, at the end of time: it loads, and that period has 7 days. tally 2.1.5's refcore refused it
# REFCORE-NOT-YET.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index ds = day 9999-12-04..9999-12-31 by 7

def len_[k in ds]: int = days_between(start_of(k), end_of(k))

ask n: len_[9999-12-25]
=== expect
n: 7
  cut 2026-12-31
